{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"bond-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"no","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"bond-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["bond-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"nb-NO","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"En obligasjonspris er nåverdien av de planlagte kupongene og hovedstolen, og en høyere diskonteringsavkastning reduserer denne nåverdien, mens en lavere avkastning øker den.","record_id":"9f7c636ac74ca72b925e9bec2e1d94a9820ba4db7e563309471f1ddfd71e349a","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":0.515969551000012,"source":"A bond price is the present value of its scheduled coupons and principal. A higher discount yield reduces that present value; a lower yield increases it.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"e92f435739cff311db059d45d31a81b0d8ee9f7edcd8603db08716f8567dfec6","status":"machine-draft","translation":"En obligasjonspris er nåverdien av de planlagte kupongene og hovedstolen, og en høyere diskonteringsavkastning reduserer denne nåverdien, mens en lavere avkastning øker den.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
